WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.789 --> 00:00:02.717
RICHARD MADDEN
Hi there, everyone.

00:00:03.617 --> 00:00:04.809
KUMAIL NANJIANI
Tickets are now on sale...

00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:06.989
SALMA HAYEK
...for Marvel Studios' Eternals.

00:00:07.039 --> 00:00:07.888
IKARIS
Let's go!

00:00:10.961 --> 00:00:11.934
GEMMA CHAN
New heroes.

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:15.124
BARRY KEOGHAN
New dangers.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:17.332
KRO
You can't protect any of them.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:18.925
LAUREN RIDLOFF
New mission.

00:00:19.457 --> 00:00:20.774
BRIAN TYREE HENRY
Get ready for a journey

00:00:20.824 --> 00:00:22.445
 thousands of years in the making.

00:00:22.832 --> 00:00:23.883
SPRITE
If this is what the end of the world

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:25.948
looks like, at least
we have front row seats.

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.412
LAUREN RIDLOFF
The Eternals.

00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:33.857
- Eternals.
- Eternals...

00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:34.749
GEMMA CHAN
...have arrived.

